				<r3d:description language="eng">The ord.fkp.jku.at portal offers a Data Repository of the JKUs Magnetic Oxides Group and provides access to the latest research data of the Magnetic Oxide research group of the Johannes Kepler University in Linz, Austria. The Repository contains Datasets in the following research areas: Dilute magnetic semiconductors and oxides, Ferromagnetic thin films and nanoparticles,  X-ray absorption spectroscopy, Element-selective structure and magnetism, Functional heterostructures and interfaces, and Frequency-dependent magnetic resonance.</r3d:description>
